==Daily events==
Most daily events reset every day at 00:00 UTC.

Some events have a [[:Category:Repeatable content with a hard reset|''hard reset'']] whereby they reset at 00:00 UTC regardless of whether a player is logged in or out, whereas other events have a [[:Category:Repeatable content with a soft reset|''soft reset'']] which means at 00:00 UTC the reset will initiate once a player has logged out of the game.

